  {
   "id": "SPMES_WR:0892",
   "jp": "建物が倒壊し、\n被害が出ているようです",
   "en": "Buildings have collapsed;\nthere seems to be damage."
  },
  {
   "id": "SPMES_WR:08AD",
   "jp": "報告は以上、\n引き続き任務に戻ります!",
   "en": "That is all to report.\nReturning to my duties!"
  },
  {
   "id": "SPMES_WR:08CA",
   "jp": "各地で猛威を振るい、甚大な\n被害が出ているようです",
   "en": "It rages everywhere, and\nthe damage seems grave."
  },
  {
   "id": "SPMES_WR:08EE",
   "jp": "周辺地城にも甚大な被害が\n及んでいるようです",
